1
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:45,630
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:46,850
[Episode 15]

3
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,380
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:56,400
Tinglan.

6
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,120
Tinglan.

7
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:06,570
Lawyer Xiao.

8
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:07,600
I'm sorry.

9
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,220
I didn't hear you just now.

10
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,400
Why are you so absent-minded lately?

11
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,930
Is something wrong at home?

12
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,160
Maybe I just haven't been

13
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,420
sleeping well lately.

14
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,860
You've worked hard recently.

15
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,200
When the project is over,

16
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,720
I'll give you a few extra days off.

17
00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:22,710
Thank you, Lawyer Xiao.

18
00:01:22,710 --> 00:01:23,200
This...

19
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:25,050
Lawyer Xiao,

20
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,240
does your family use

21
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:29,240
Zhuoyuan Technology's products?

22
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:30,360
How do you feel?

23
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,539
I felt really good.

24
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:38,120
Ms. Wen said
if there are any problems during use,

25
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,640
we can report them
to the technical department,

26
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,240
and they will debug it again.

27
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,000
Zhao,

28
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:10,120
pull up last month's user error reports.

29
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:10,650
Let me take a look.

30
00:03:10,650 --> 00:03:11,480
Okay, Ms. Wen.

31
00:03:13,290 --> 00:03:15,030
[Check if the users have existed.]

32
00:03:15,050 --> 00:03:15,900
[Check the password format]

33
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,200
Look, Ms. Wen.

34
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:19,480
What about this week's data?

35
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:20,200
Filter it separately.

36
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:20,760
Okay.

37
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:22,040
[Electronic Lock System is completed.]

38
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:22,579
[Verification user password is correct]

39
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:24,079
[function statement]

40
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,560
Ms. Wen.

41
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:35,200
Make a separate copy

42
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,640
of this week's data for me.

43
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:37,320
Well...

44
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:40,000
I need to take it with me to check.

45
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,040
Okay.

46
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:54,560
Done, Ms. Wen.

47
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:56,880
Thank you.

48
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:57,970
You're welcome.

49
00:05:02,490 --> 00:05:03,620
[Let everyone
enjoy the fun of technology.]

50
00:05:28,230 --> 00:05:29,070
[Call] [Nannan]

51
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:30,130
[Nannan]

52
00:05:43,150 --> 00:05:45,750
[Contact] [Zhuo Yu'an]

53
00:05:45,770 --> 00:05:48,230
[Zhuo Yu'an]

54
00:05:51,210 --> 00:05:52,500
[Tinglan]

55
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,650
Hello, Tinglan.

56
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,770
Why are you still up so late?

57
00:06:05,150 --> 00:06:05,910
Hello.

58
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,040
Hello.

59
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,420
Did something happen?

60
00:06:11,450 --> 00:06:12,160
Zhuo Yu'an.

61
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,520
Are you busy?

62
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,960
I'm on a business trip overseas.

63
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,040
Never mind then.

64
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:20,560
Get back to work.

65
00:06:20,790 --> 00:06:21,680
Wait.

66
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:23,840
Did something happen

67
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,040
on your end?

68
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,960
Can you hear

69
00:06:36,140 --> 00:06:38,000
my doorbell ringing constantly?

70
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,659
Not just the doorbell,

71
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:43,000
the TV is making noise too.

72
00:06:45,030 --> 00:06:46,000
No.

73
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,210
Not in the house.

74
00:06:47,860 --> 00:06:49,120
It's in my head.

75
00:06:54,710 --> 00:06:55,400
Tinglan.

76
00:06:55,790 --> 00:06:57,120
Calm down first.

77
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,240
Then I won't hang up.

78
00:07:05,150 --> 00:07:06,350
Try to get some sleep.

79
00:07:06,910 --> 00:07:08,560
I can't close my eyes.

80
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:10,530
Someone is watching me.

81
00:07:11,930 --> 00:07:12,600
It's okay.

82
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,570
You don't have to sleep yet.

83
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:17,070
I'll stay here and chat with you.

84
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,280
Okay.

85
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:23,160
[Zhuo Yu'an]

86
00:07:22,330 --> 00:07:23,260
Tinglan.

87
00:07:24,210 --> 00:07:25,950
On my way to work today,

88
00:07:25,970 --> 00:07:27,240
I saw a kind of bird.

89
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,120
It was a gray bird.

90
00:07:30,410 --> 00:07:32,080
It flew past the car window

91
00:07:32,370 --> 00:07:34,120
and quickly flew away.

92
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:38,280
It's not a bird we usually see in Senzhou,

93
00:07:39,420 --> 00:07:41,240
but in Qining.

94
00:07:43,970 --> 00:07:45,570
It always flies to our window

95
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:48,680
in the summer.

96
00:08:11,330 --> 00:08:13,340
[Outpatient]

97
00:08:12,410 --> 00:08:13,870
For the past month or so,

98
00:08:13,890 --> 00:08:16,460
Have you been experiencing insomnia
and auditory hallucinations?

99
00:08:16,460 --> 00:08:17,480
Yes.

100
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,970
I have trouble falling asleep.

101
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,560
In the corners of my house,

102
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,620
I always feel like someone is hiding.

103
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:25,050
Sometimes when I go out,

104
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,100
I feel like they're following me.

105
00:08:27,100 --> 00:08:29,900
Are there any major changes
in your life recently?

106
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,880
Doctor,

107
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:37,440
my mom has this condition too.

108
00:08:37,830 --> 00:08:39,240
Could it be hereditary?

109
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,450
Your mother's illness was caused by

110
00:08:41,450 --> 00:08:43,240
external stimuli,

111
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,570
so it's not hereditary.

112
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,800
I can prescribe you some

113
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:48,320
tranquilizers.

114
00:08:48,570 --> 00:08:49,360
When you have time,

115
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:51,080
go to the park to get some sun

116
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,160
and relax.

117
00:08:52,450 --> 00:08:54,430
If the symptoms don't improve,

118
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:55,920
come back for a follow-up.

119
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:57,640
Yeah.

120
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:14,280
You've made a lot of progress lately.

121
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,990
Yeah, you skate pretty well too.

122
00:09:15,990 --> 00:09:17,790
We can learn together next time.

123
00:09:33,830 --> 00:09:37,480
♪ I'll wait for you in the crowd ♪

124
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:44,260
♪ Hearts in sync—how incredible ♪

125
00:09:41,270 --> 00:09:42,340
Yi Muyang, what are you looking at?

126
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:43,030
Yi Muyang.

127
00:09:43,090 --> 00:09:43,840
Yi Muyang!

128
00:09:45,490 --> 00:09:50,040
♪ It's the cloak of a close embrace ♪

129
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:50,520
Hi

130
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:56,020
♪ It's the steadfast days and
nights we share ♪

131
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:55,460
Do you remember me?

132
00:09:57,150 --> 00:10:02,310
♪ When we weather the storm together,
don't forget ♪

133
00:10:02,990 --> 00:10:07,530
♪ Breathing in the long river of time ♪

134
00:10:03,690 --> 00:10:06,220
You're the kind person
in the street that day.

135
00:10:07,340 --> 00:10:08,680
That's a unique nickname.

136
00:10:08,180 --> 00:10:13,660
♪ My only promise is to you ♪

137
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:11,350
My name is Yi Muyang.

138
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,080
"Yang" means the rising sun.

139
00:10:15,890 --> 00:10:18,550
♪ Between us ♪

140
00:10:18,790 --> 00:10:21,700
♪ Suspicion feels so far away ♪

141
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:27,560
♪ When our eyes meet,
I feel your burning gaze ♪

142
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:31,060
♪ The wind by the shore has stilled ♪

143
00:10:31,220 --> 00:10:32,200
Thank you.

144
00:10:31,370 --> 00:10:33,880
♪ And you're smiling too ♪

145
00:10:33,710 --> 00:10:34,800
Are you okay?

146
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:36,670
♪ Make a wish to the wind ♪

147
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:37,720
You

148
00:10:37,070 --> 00:10:42,200
♪ It's Cupid's arrow,
set loose from the string ♪

149
00:10:38,030 --> 00:10:39,470
don't live around here, do you?

150
00:10:39,470 --> 00:10:41,170
I haven't seen you here before.

151
00:10:41,170 --> 00:10:41,760
Right.

152
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,760
I came here on business today,

153
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:44,960
just to clear my mind.

154
00:10:45,220 --> 00:10:46,640
You really should clear your mind.

155
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:47,770
Every time I see you,

156
00:10:48,620 --> 00:10:50,120
you don't look very happy.

157
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:56,610
♪ I'll wait for you in the crowd ♪

158
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,120
Yi Muyang.

159
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,120
Want to try?

160
00:10:57,630 --> 00:11:02,850
♪ Hearts in sync—how incredible ♪

161
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,790
Let me teach you

162
00:10:58,790 --> 00:10:59,570
I...

163
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:03,840
You guys go ahead and play.

164
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:05,520
I'm really not good at sports.

165
00:11:04,570 --> 00:11:09,360
♪ It's the familiar breath we share ♪

166
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:07,290
Are you sure you don't want to try?

167
00:11:07,290 --> 00:11:08,280
It's a lot of fun.

168
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,160
Alright.

169
00:11:09,610 --> 00:11:14,900
♪ It's being each other's exception ♪

170
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:12,080
Then watch me skate.

171
00:11:13,730 --> 00:11:14,720
By the way,

172
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:16,230
what's your name?

173
00:11:16,230 --> 00:11:21,440
♪ When tides ebb and flow, I look to you ♪

174
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,600
My name is Shu Tinglan.

175
00:11:19,050 --> 00:11:20,200
Shu Tinglan.

176
00:11:22,070 --> 00:11:26,800
♪ Drowning in the long river of time ♪

177
00:11:23,620 --> 00:11:25,520
When I'm in a bad mood, I eat candy.

178
00:11:25,690 --> 00:11:27,270
I feel much better after eating it.

179
00:11:27,270 --> 00:11:33,570
♪ You're the only air I breathe ♪

180
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,400
Thank you.

181
00:11:34,980 --> 00:11:37,280
♪ Between us ♪

182
00:11:37,830 --> 00:11:40,600
♪ The image of us holding each other ♪

183
00:11:41,230 --> 00:11:46,670
♪ I see the dream encounter of that day ♪

184
00:11:46,900 --> 00:11:49,930
The rain outside the window stopped

185
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:52,190
We're still here

186
00:12:26,210 --> 00:12:27,100
Tinglan

187
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,190
Tinglan!

188
00:12:28,210 --> 00:12:29,640
Tinglan!

189
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:37,840
Be careful!

190
00:12:40,110 --> 00:12:43,960
♪ Then I met you, in this moment ♪

191
00:12:44,050 --> 00:12:47,100
♪ Like drifting into a dream ♪

192
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:53,030
♪ In the dream, stars carry a boat
toward the shore ♪

193
00:12:53,530 --> 00:12:56,360
♪ Your faint light lingers ♪

194
00:12:56,740 --> 00:13:00,750
♪ Spreading a warm current
through my heart ♪

195
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:03,260
♪ Our eyes meet ♪

196
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:07,290
♪ Bit by bit, healing the wounds ♪

197
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:11,660
♪ I fear when the dream ends ♪

198
00:13:12,530 --> 00:13:15,390
♪ I'll have to let go of that tenderness ♪
